  "level": "중",
  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "다항식 $(a+2b+c)^2+(a-b+c)^2+(a+b-c)^2$ 을 전개하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$3a^2+6b^2+3c^2+4ab+2ca$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$(a+2b+c)^2+(a-b+c)^2+(a+b-c)^2$을 전개하면\n$$\\begin{aligned}&=a^2+4b^2+c^2+4ab+4bc+2ca\\\\&\\quad+a^2+b^2+c^2-2ab-2bc+2ca\\\\&\\quad+a^2+b^2+c^2+2ab-2bc-2ca\\\\&=3a^2+6b^2+3c^2+4ab+2ca\\end{aligned}$$",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "FAN-공수1-U1-008",
  "source": "학원교재",
