  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "다항식 $(a+b+2c)^2+(a-2b+c)^2+(-2a+b+c)^2$ 을 전개하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$6a^2+6b^2+6c^2-6ab+2bc+2ca$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$(a+b+2c)^2+(a-2b+c)^2+(-2a+b+c)^2$\n을 전개하면\n$$\\begin{aligned}&=a^2+b^2+4c^2+2ab+4bc+4ca\\\\&\\quad+a^2+4b^2+c^2-4ab-4bc+2ca\\\\&\\quad+4a^2+b^2+c^2-4ab+2bc-4ca\\\\&=6a^2+6b^2+6c^2-6ab+2bc+2ca\\end{aligned}$$",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "FAN-공수1-U1-009",
  "source": "학원교재",
  "book": "세쌍둥이 유형편 공통수학1",
