  "level": "중",
  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "다항식 $(x+2)(x-2)(x^2+2x+4)(x^2-2x+4)$를 전개하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$x^6-64$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$(x+2)(x-2)(x^2+2x+4)(x^2-2x+4)$\n을 전개하면\n$$\\begin{aligned}&=\\{(x+2)(x-2)\\}\\{(x^2-2x+4)(x^2+2x+4)\\}\\\\&=(x^2-4)(x^4+4x^2+16)\\\\&=x^6-64\\end{aligned}$$",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "FAN-공수1-U1-010",
  "source": "학원교재",
  "book": "세쌍둥이 유형편 공통수학1",
