  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$x^4-2x^2+x-5=A(x^2-3x+1)+(16x-11)$\n이므로\n$$\\begin{aligned}A(x^2-3x+1)&=x^4-2x^2+x-5-(16x-11)\\\\&=x^4-2x^2-15x+6\\end{aligned}$$\n$\\therefore\\ A=(x^4-2x^2-15x+6)\\div(x^2-3x+1)$\n$$\\begin{array}{rl} & x^2+3x+6 \\\\ x^2-3x+1\\ \\big) & x^4\\phantom{-3x^3}-2x^2-15x+6 \\\\ & x^4-3x^3+x^2 \\\\ \\hline & \\phantom{x^4-}3x^3-3x^2-15x+6 \\\\ & \\phantom{x^4-}3x^3-9x^2+3x \\\\ \\hline & \\phantom{x^4-3x^3+}6x^2-18x+6 \\\\ & \\phantom{x^4-3x^3+}6x^2-18x+6 \\\\ \\hline & \\phantom{x^4-3x^3+6x^2-18x+}0 \\end{array}$$\n따라서 $A=x^2+3x+6$ 이다.",
